    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turbĭnātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		2. turbo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>coneshaped</i>, <i>pointed like a
			cone</i>, <i>conical.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adamas ... turbinatus in mucronem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 4, 15, § 56</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 37, 69,
				§ 181</span></i>. —<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turbinatior piris figura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 15, 17, § 58</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> As
				<i>adj. propr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapis Turbinatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 3304</span></i>
			 and 6616.</div>
